dataset and measurement methods are not detailed.[6] A widely circulated image caption on a non-scholarly platform further characterizes it as a "Minoan Kakovatos signet ring" of Late Minoan I date, circa 1700–1450 BCE, showing four cult scenes, and gives its weight as 31.8 units, while stating that 
