the material available here it is identified in the Corpus der Minoischen und Mykenischen Siegel as CMS VI no. 277 and summarized in an abstract and associated platform-generated notes as one of the larger Aegean signet rings, with reported dimensions of about 3.29 cm by 2.18 cm.[6] A widely 
